WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:10.838
"Hello!" Chef greeted the kids.

2
00:00:10.839 --> 00:00:13.239
"Today is my birthday.

3
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:19.507
I like to celebrate by eating a favorite food.

4
00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:23.775
So, we’re making salmon cakes."

5
00:00:23.776 --> 00:00:32.134
"Happy Birthday!" the kids said.

6
00:00:32.135 --> 00:00:35.716
They washed their hands and put on their aprons.

7
00:00:35.717 --> 00:00:40.628
"I wish I knew it was Chef’s birthday," Izzie whispered.

8
00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:43.836
"We don't have a card or present."

9
00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:48.137
"Let’s try not to upset him today," Jason said.

10
00:00:48.138 --> 00:00:50.892
"That’s a good present!"

11
00:00:50.893 --> 00:00:54.785
"I baked the salmon in advance," Chef said.

12
00:00:54.786 --> 00:01:01.874
"Let's start by preparing the vegetables."

13
00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:07.384
Bobby and Izzie chopped an onion and a bell pepper.

14
00:01:07.385 --> 00:01:11.696
"Chef should have a birthday cake," Izzie whispered.

15
00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:20.247
"It’s too late to bake one for him," Jason whispered back.

16
00:01:20.248 --> 00:01:25.709
Nina added butter and olive oil to a frying pan.

17
00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:30.598
Chef hummed to himself as he cooked the pepper and onion.

18
00:01:30.599 --> 00:01:34.740
"I know! I’ll text my mom," Izzie said.

19
00:01:34.741 --> 00:01:38.511
"I can ask her to buy Chef a cake."

20
00:01:38.512 --> 00:01:42.282
"Don’t forget the candles!" Nina said.

21
00:01:42.283 --> 00:01:48.705
"I’ll distract Chef while you text your mom," Bobby said.

22
00:01:48.706 --> 00:01:51.398
Bobby walked up to Chef.

23
00:01:51.399 --> 00:01:54.186
"Hey, Chef, watch this!"

24
00:01:54.187 --> 00:01:57.635
He dropped to the floor and began doing push-ups.

25
00:01:57.636 --> 00:02:01.068
"I can do fifty push-ups."

26
00:02:01.069 --> 00:02:04.345
"Bobby, get up!" Chef shouted.

27
00:02:04.346 --> 00:02:07.186
"This is a kitchen, not a gym!

28
00:02:07.187 --> 00:02:10.818
Wash your hands again."

29
00:02:10.819 --> 00:02:14.851
Izzie looked up from her phone to see Chef frowning at her.

30
00:02:14.852 --> 00:02:18.183
"Put your phone away. Now!"

31
00:02:18.184 --> 00:02:22.823
"Sorry, Chef!" Izzie put her phone away.

32
00:02:22.824 --> 00:02:30.073
Jason sighed. "We can’t get through one class without annoying him."

33
00:02:30.074 --> 00:02:35.307
"Now we combine the ingredients," Chef said.

34
00:02:35.308 --> 00:02:40.629
Jason cracked two eggs into a bowl and whisked them.

35
00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:46.115
Izzie broke up the salmon and added it to the bowl.

36
00:02:46.116 --> 00:02:49.375
Chef put in the vegetables.

37
00:02:49.376 --> 00:02:54.676
Nina poured in one cup of panko, and Bobby added mayonnaise.

38
00:02:54.677 --> 00:02:57.290
"Next we add the seasonings."

39
00:02:57.291 --> 00:03:03.436
Jason measured a teaspoon of Worcestershire sauce.

40
00:03:03.437 --> 00:03:06.668
Nina added garlic salt.

41
00:03:06.669 --> 00:03:14.257
Bobby sprinkled in black pepper, and Izzie added fresh parsley.

42
00:03:14.258 --> 00:03:21.276
Chef stirred until all the ingredients were mixed together.

43
00:03:21.277 --> 00:03:27.036
He showed the kids how to form the cakes.

44
00:03:27.037 --> 00:03:33.230
"Now we can cook them," Nina said.

45
00:03:33.231 --> 00:03:38.387
Bobby heated oil and butter in a pan.

46
00:03:38.388 --> 00:03:44.988
Chef began frying the cakes. "Don’t they smell delicious?"

47
00:03:44.989 --> 00:03:48.823
He flipped each cake to the other side.

48
00:03:48.824 --> 00:03:52.569
After each cake was cooked, he put it on a plate.

49
00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:56.874
The plate was covered with a paper towel.

50
00:03:56.875 --> 00:04:00.119
"This will absorb the oil."

51
00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:08.276
Izzie frowned. "There must be something we can do for Chef’s birthday."

52
00:04:08.277 --> 00:04:12.015
She noticed a bowl of greens on the counter.

53
00:04:12.016 --> 00:04:16.384
There were also some carrot sticks and grape tomatoes.

54
00:04:16.385 --> 00:04:19.339
"I have an idea!"

55
00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.622
She turned to Chef.

56
00:04:21.623 --> 00:04:24.357
"We have a surprise for you.

57
00:04:24.358 --> 00:04:28.014
Could you step outside for a minute?"

58
00:04:28.015 --> 00:04:35.580
"A surprise isn’t necessary," he said.

59
00:04:35.581 --> 00:04:38.596
But he left the kitchen.

60
00:04:38.597 --> 00:04:41.733
Izzie showed everyone her idea.

61
00:04:41.734 --> 00:04:46.583
"Awesome!" Nina said.

62
00:04:46.584 --> 00:04:52.914
Bobby got Chef.

63
00:04:52.915 --> 00:04:56.571
Izzie held up the plate of salmon cakes.

64
00:04:56.572 --> 00:04:59.483
They were lying on a bed of greens.

65
00:04:59.484 --> 00:05:03.478
One cake had a carrot stick stuck in it like a candle.

66
00:05:03.479 --> 00:05:06.540
There was a grape tomato for the flame.

67
00:05:06.541 --> 00:05:10.145
"Here is your birthday salmon cake.

68
00:05:10.146 --> 00:05:14.807
And you can eat the candle," Izzie said.

69
00:05:14.808 --> 00:05:24.963
Chef laughed. "What a delicious surprise!"

